pe":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScriptedAlchemy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/core/commits/1b4ff2e7bc72711586cfc0f88d1cd0c08a0b661d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:46:39Z","email":"25274700+ScriptedAlchemy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Zack Jackson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:46:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(esbuild): resolve paths from absWorkingDir instead of process.cwd() (#5148)\n\nesbuild reports metafile output paths relative to absWorkingDir. The plugin resolved them, and the manifest''s shared package.json lookups, from process.cwd(), so a build with a different absWorkingDir failed with ENOENT on dist/remoteEntry.js or wrote its manifest next to the process. Builds that do not set absWorkingDir are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"a16ddc0d17edd6c84efbb53b387b88f3c8c25ffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/core/git/trees/a16ddc0d17edd6c84efbb53b387b88f3c8c25ffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/core/git/commits/1b4ff2e7bc72711586cfc0f88d1cd0c08a0b661d","verification":{"payload":"tree a16ddc0d17edd6c84efbb53b387b88f3c8c25ffc\nparent 2b205dc9abf0452f60c3269330a6502495585fa0\nauthor Zack Jackson <25274700+ScriptedAlchemy@users.noreply.github.com> 1790397999 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790397999 -0700\n\nfix(esbuild): resolve paths from absWorkingDir instead of process.cwd() (#5148)\n\nesbuild reports metafile output paths relative to absWorkingDir. The plugin resolved them, and the manifest''s shared package.json lookups, from process.cwd(), so a build with a different absWorkingDir failed with ENOENT on dist/remoteEntry.js or wrote its manifest next to the process. Builds that do not set absWorkingDir are unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt04vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+3MQAH1DTa4RsPRjQ53muvoERfB7\nms7