users/ckken","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/commits/e1eef48701674217c9e7f96046a51a01bf40915d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T05:54:18Z","email":"ckken@qq.com","name":"ckken"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T05:54:18Z","email":"ckken@qq.com","name":"ckken"},"message":"feat(cli): 弃置无生效路径的配置字段并给出迁移告警\n\nCLI 配置 API\n- 移除公开字段：debug.progress、moduleTransform、store.isOldRspack，以及\n  server.httpsType（自 v3.7.1 f6bf1fd9 引入起即零读取点的 write-only 死末端）\n- server.http2 / debug.showPerformance / debug.newTreeshaking 属「已对外公开但无\n  生效路径」，按兼容策略保留接收并显式告警：检测在 setup() 早期采样式，上报放在\n  clearConsole() 之后（清屏含 ESC[3J 回滚缓冲，之前打印的告警对真人不可见）\n- cache.maxVersions 由静默 delete 改为先 logger.warn 再丢弃\n- 配置文件双拼写（emp-config.* 与 emp.config.*）同目录共存时直接报错并列出路径\n\n验证与守卫\n- legacy-config-compat 成为 @empjs/plugin-postcss 的全仓唯一真实消费方（其他 CSS\n  应用走 lightningcss，按设计不挂 postcss-loader）：三层断言＝挂载的 postcss-loader\n  / 产物 CSS 20rem / 浏览器 offsetWidth 随根字号缩放，每层均做过反向探针\n- test/release.rules.test.ts 新增守卫：根 .npmrc 仅允许授权与 registry 键；内部包\n  依赖必须使用 workspace: 协议\n\n仓库配置\n- 删除无效 .npmrc：pnpm 12 只从它读授权与 registry，其余设置一律静默忽略，已迁至\n  pnpm-workspace.yaml\n\n其余\n- 多个插件包补 @deprecated 标注与类型文档修正\n- 同步 docs 与 skills 参考文档、apps 特性测试矩阵","tree":{"sha":"b38ef0b440b8e37022ca871ff1c5a87c5926d5fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/git/trees/b38ef0b440b8e37022ca871ff1c5a87c5926d5fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/git/commits/e1eef48701674217c9e7f96046a51a01bf40915d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890513?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:/