nts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/commits/6a81d50c6c8b5e1028690b6a51378c5d5c45dcda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:59:10Z","email":"ckken@qq.com","name":"ckken"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:59:10Z","email":"ckken@qq.com","name":"ckken"},"message":"feat(cli): 移除 build.preset，改用 targets/format/polyfill 并校验弃用别名\n\n破坏性变更：build.preset 与 BuildPresetName 整体移除（chrome60 / modern 不再存在）。\n替代写法是显式 build.targets + build.format + build.polyfill。\n\n配置 API\n- 删除 packages/cli/src/store/buildPresets.ts、types/config.ts 的 BuildPresetName 与 preset 字段、\n  empConfig 的 getBuildPreset\n- 新增弃用别名冲突校验，命中即显式报错而非静默生效：\n  format × useESM、targets × target、targets × polyfill.browserslist、\n  sourcemap.js × devtool、css.prefixName × css.prifixName\n- apps/demo 由 preset 迁到显式 targets / format / polyfill\n\n验收与用例\n- 新增 apps/legacy-config-compat：完整构建 + 归一化配置断言（test/config-shape.mjs）+\n  产物契约 + 浏览器交互，并接入 apps:acceptance\n- 新增 apps/demo 与 apps/legacy-config-compat 的兼容性浏览器用例\n- 新增 packages/lib-react-17、packages/lib-vue-2 的 adapter 运行时浏览器用例\n\n工程\n- 抽取私有包 packages/dev-services（暴露 emp-static bin），静态资源服务定义与实现一并迁入\n- 工作区包脚本不再出现跨包 ../ 相对路径，serve 类脚本统一以 emp-static 开头；\n  emp-workflow-check 增加对应守卫\n- skills/emp 参考文档重构为 configuration / build-compatibility / legacy-compatibility /\n  html-server-css / advanced-configuration，SKILL.md 路由与 test/agent-first-skill.rules.test.ts 同步\n- 修正 apps/test 中陈旧的 pnpm@10.33.0 硬编码（撞根包 engines.pnpm 12.x）\n- 4 个 vue app 的 workspace:^* 非法 spec 改为 workspace:^\n\n依赖\n- @rstest/core、@rstest/browser 0.11.11 → 0.11.12；playwright 1.62.0 → 1.63.0\n- @rspack/core 2.2.1 → 2.2.3；@biomejs/biome 2.3.13 → 2.5.12\n- react / react-dom / @types 19.2.x → 19.3.0；vue 3.5.20 → 3.5.42\n- tailwindcss 与 @tailwindcss/webpack 4.3.1 → 4.3.3；react-refresh 0.18.0 → 0.19.0\n- fs-extra 11.4.0、jiti 2.7.0、sass-embedded 1.104.0、sass-loader 17.0.1、serve-static 2.2.1\n\n门禁：workflow:check、test:toolchain 12/12、test:rules 55/55、ci:verify 全链 9 步、\napps:acceptance 15/15、test:apps:browser 20 文件 / 24 用例，全部通过。","tree":{"sha":"2672fd7d54247819596511706935fdc304aebc31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/git/trees/2672fd7d54247819596511706935fdc304aebc31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/git/commits/6a81d50c6c8b5e1028690b6a51378c5d5c45dcda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890513?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ckken","id":3890513,"login":"ckken","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTA1MTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckken","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/empjs/emp/commit/6a81d50c6c8b5e1028690b6a51378c5d5c45dcda","node_id":"C_kwDOEl9NddoAKDZhODFkNTBjNmM4YjVlMTAyODY5MGI2YTUxMzc4YzVkNWM0NWRjZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/empjs/emp/commit/ec2207c7466a7af7838598fd4db26edeca4c61aa","sha":"ec2207c7466a7af7838598fd4db26edeca4c61aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/commits/ec2207c7466a7af7838598fd4db26edeca4c61aa"}],"sha":"6a81d50c6c8b5e1028690b6a51378c5d5c45dcda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/empjs/emp/commits/6a81d50c6c8b5e1028690b6a51378c5d5c45dcda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890513?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user