105abf0d9ccffcade153a5c8b2dac16e9b94f","node_id":"C_kwDOEqKwutoAKDU2ZDEwNWFiZjBkOWNjZmZjYWRlMTUzYTVjOGIyZGFjMTZlOWI5NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commit/8609b97799feb4d56a4a8fdb03114925c5224eb4","sha":"8609b97799feb4d56a4a8fdb03114925c5224eb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/8609b97799feb4d56a4a8fdb03114925c5224eb4"}],"sha":"56d105abf0d9ccffcade153a5c8b2dac16e9b94f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/56d105abf0d9ccffcade153a5c8b2dac16e9b94f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69015179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aldemylla","id":69015179,"login":"Aldemylla","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDE1MTc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aldemylla","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/8609b97799feb4d56a4a8fdb03114925c5224eb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:06:13Z","email":"aldemylla@gmail.com","name":"Aldemylla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T21:06:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement ProjectSelector and ProjectSelectorItem components at Topbar (#1195)\n\n### Type of Change\n\n- [x] Feature\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Chore\n- [x] Locales\n\n### Why\n\nThe project switcher was embedded in the sidebar as a dropdown, which limited its visibility and usability. Moving it to the topbar gives it a more prominent and accessible position, and allows for a richer UI with project status indicators.\n\n### What Changed\n\n- Removed the project selector dropdown from the `Sidebar`, including the project list fetching logic, org role permission checks, and related styles.\n- Added a new `ProjectSelector` component to the topbar that uses a `UnnnicPopover` to display the list of available projects, with the current project shown first, followed by up to 5 others from the org.\n- Added a new `ProjectSelectorItem` component that renders each project with its name and a status tag (`Active` or `In test`).\n- The topbar now shows the `ProjectSelector` when a current project is loaded, replacing the logo slot in non-logo pages.\n- Project loading logic was moved to the `ProjectSelector` component, delegating to `projectStore.loadProjects`.\n- Topbar layout adjusted: height reduced, alignment changed to `flex-start`, and useful links pushed to the right via `margin-left: auto`.\n- Added `STATUS_ACTIVE` and `STATUS_IN_TEST` locale keys in English, Spanish, Portuguese, and Romanian.\n\n### Diagram\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Topbar --> ProjectSelector\n    ProjectSelector --> ProjectSelectorItem\n    ProjectSelector --> projectStore\n    ProjectSelector --> orgStore\n    ProjectSelector --> router\n\n    projectStore --> visibleProjects\n    visibleProjects --> ProjectSelectorItem\n```\n\n### Demonstration\n\n![image.png](https://app.graphite.com/user-attachments/assets/58999092-2be8-4a72-bb17-51d9913df3a0.png)","tree":{"sha":"cdba0d8edd0af26ebb586928cec94c2b1bf37812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/trees/cdba0d8edd0af26ebb586928cec94c2b1bf37812"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/commits/8609b97799feb4d56a4a8fdb03114925c5224eb4","verification":{"payload":"tree cdba0d8edd0af26ebb586928cec94c2b1bf37812\nparent 18122585edd7f71fc4a0a73ad36b1f708100da49\nparent b243e684b57037225743382debe2307124bf0e05\nauthor Aldemylla <aldemylla@gmail.com> 1789074373 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789074373 -0300\n\nfeat: implement ProjectSelector and ProjectSelectorItem components at Topbar (#1195)\n\n### Type of Change\n\n- [x] Feature\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Chore\n- [x] Locales\n\n### Why\n\nThe project switcher was embedded in the sidebar as a dropdown, which limited its visibility and usability. Moving it to the topbar gives it a more prominent and accessible position, and allows for a richer UI with project status indicators.\n\n### What Changed\n\n- Removed the project selector dropdown from the `Sidebar`, including the project list fetching logic, org role permission checks, and related styles.\n- Added a new `ProjectSelector` component to the topbar that uses a `UnnnicPopover` to display the list of available projects, with the current project shown first, followed by up to 5 others from the org.\n- Added a new `ProjectSelectorItem` component that renders each project with its name and a status tag (`Active` or `In test`).\n- The topbar now shows the `ProjectSelector` when a current project is loaded, replacing the logo slot in non-logo pages.\n- Project loading logic was moved to the `ProjectSelector` component, delegating to `projectStore.loadProjects`.\n- Topbar layout adjusted: height reduced, alignment changed to `flex-start`, and useful links pushed to the right via `margin-left: auto`.\n- Added `STATUS_ACTIVE` and `STATUS_IN_TEST` locale keys in English, Spanish, Portuguese, and Romanian.\n\n### Diagram\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Topbar --> ProjectSelector\n    ProjectSelector --> ProjectSelectorItem\n    ProjectSelector --> projectStore\n    ProjectSelector --> orgStore\n    ProjectSelector --> router\n\n    projectStore --> visibleProjects\n    visibleProjects --> ProjectSelectorItem\n```\n\n### Demonstration\n\n![image.png](https://app.graphite.com/user-attachments/assets/58999092-2be8-4a72-bb17-51d9913df3a0.png)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoxvFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUo8QAEITXYDL8onnIxzm9SQIyDwJ\nTHHo1GctAKI/fnXbLYyb1DqEnvqOw6B02sy82NA4b0hDM/nPQ+DYSAEtPVv3XBRr\nn46evKhY/7VV/zO86DF8p52uml3Jp3YANSxOZTYz23E6YXD8odsHOXNor+NnobYq\nbsTOWsyDYd5dr2cfBfS3vtDN5SAp8nOfADiD3YINkm03JsBkhJfTYIeJZoRCtcPH\nRMCS7piCAKj09pl1Qk7ZSZihujxL7CF2W7++t8c+X0NhVgLOZXs4vmEWKY2dYYpI\nwfb/FAsaM8Y2upohTOl73y28TyIMzUgHwXcjaQda12TgKDVEVXyMG0az3lsFCHKa\nW7FUA0VhyDrCDEf5yMt5eD+50ZXAxmCrJ8gTtZYsPIJDmUHk5PTjb3t1XIyeiFXW\nuMtEjXOIrZ/ZJehA8cv6Ko4s/ofERPuPx3nXDyPZsyUn4FmyJ44H8ZQPUWtAi2bE\nhVMzlM+W7L0iIIgcqaQiMxDPIExLDlg6lpAAsU/H6ImzdJ4Q4Cy1l5Yw6//0XC2e\nNJQvjT1QSPyFMPlU/qwDUQWKwxiBLKRMmWdg53NJ9LsI4DcIYbKH3wXAJEox2Rci\nk9GiCe7jXz8cdz2bgCdl8hC6Ly61N5m1h4F/VvlgjPN75ngxTqzFF/U+J5C84TP7\nl9vUgVPeQVU1de7ZrXa3\n=vWmd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T21:06:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl