ation management from Vuex to a new Pinia store, enhancing state management and reactivity.\n- Updated components to utilize the new Pinia store, including methods for handling organizations and their related data.\n- Removed legacy Vuex actions and integrated new Pinia actions for organization functionality.\n- Added unit tests for the new organization store to ensure proper functionality and reliability.","tree":{"sha":"69498983e4d8052e33c69eb901b0b599a82e6bbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/trees/69498983e4d8052e33c69eb901b0b599a82e6bbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/commits/9e7ef80616d0cfa07988076cbbe4a0c7d1cb3ee0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30026625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulobernardoaf","id":30026625,"login":"paulobernardoaf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDI2NjI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commit/9e7ef80616d0cfa07988076cbbe4a0c7d1cb3ee0","node_id":"C_kwDOEqKwutoAKDllN2VmODA2MTZkMGNmYTA3OTg4MDc2Y2JiZTRhMGM3ZDFjYjNl