dded unit tests for the new billing steps store to ensure proper functionality and reliability.","tree":{"sha":"9e88f624e9abf658ae67211a16b0f86f01bc5431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/trees/9e88f624e9abf658ae67211a16b0f86f01bc5431"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/commits/ba9b9126f302f3b3f0d9c892259d2ab252b93ce1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30026625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulobernardoaf","id":30026625,"login":"paulobernardoaf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDI2NjI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commit/ba9b9126f302f3b3f0d9c892259d2ab252b93ce1","node_id":"C_kwDOEqKwutoAKGJhOWI5MTI2ZjMwMmYzYjNmMGQ5Yzg5MjI1OWQyYWIyNTJiOTNjZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commit/cc98cd2497c125b85f7f97a9ba1cb3aa53449dee","sha":"cc98cd2497c125b85f7f97a9ba1cb3aa53449dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/cc98cd2497c125b85f7f97a9ba1cb3aa53449dee"}],"sha":"ba9b9126f302f3b3f0d9c892259d2ab252b93ce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/ba9b9126f302f3b3f0d9c892259d2ab252b93ce1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30026625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulobernardoaf","id":30026625,"login":"paulobernardoaf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDI2NjI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/cc98cd2497c125b85f7f97a9ba1cb3aa53449dee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:11:32Z","email":"paulo.bernardo@vtex.com","name":"Paulo Bernardo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:11:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: migrate billing management from Vuex to Pinia (#1187)\n\n### Type of Change\n- [ ] Feature\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [x] Refactor\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Chore\n- [ ] Locales\n\n### Why\nThe billing store was implemented as a Vuex module, which is inconsistent with the rest of the codebase''s migration toward Pinia. Moving it to Pinia improves consistency, removes the need for the `store` context argument in actions, and enables proper unit testing with `@pinia/testing`.\n\n### What Changed\n- Converted the billing Vuex module (`src/store/billing/index.js` and `actions.js`) into a Pinia store using `defineStore` with the composition API style.\n- Removed the `Billing` module from the Vuex store registration in `src/store/index.js`.\n- Updated `billing.vue`, `activeContacts.vue`, and `invoices.vue` to map actions from `useBillingStore` via Pinia''s `mapActions` instead of Vuex''s.\n- Added unit tests for `useBillingStore` covering all actions, including default argument handling and error propagation.\n- Updated the existing `billing.spec.js` view test to mock `getActiveContacts` through the Pinia testing store instead of a Vuex action mock.","tree":{"sha":"c5a3c9c111aa221740ec2714bd85f132f2c3558c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/trees/c5a3c9c111aa221740ec2714bd85f132f2c3558c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/commits/cc98cd2497c125b85f7f97a9ba1cb3aa53449dee","verification":{"payload":"tree c5a3c9c111aa221740ec2714bd85f132f2c3558c\nparent f7d08f85f37f2ea984c4a575284cfa8b30e3e5d5\nparent 720e40ed92459a8d81df5c7b4386423c40e1983b\nauthor Paulo Bernardo <paulo.bernardo@vtex.com> 1787919092 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787919092 -0300\n\nrefactor: migrate billing management from Vuex to Pinia (#1187)\n\n### Type of Change\n- [ ] Feature\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [x] Refactor\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Chore\n- [ ] Locales\n\n### Why\nThe billing store was implemented as a Vuex module, which is inconsistent with the rest of the codebase''s migration toward Pinia. Moving it to Pinia improves consistency, removes the need for the `store` context argument in actions, and enables proper unit testing with `@pinia/testing`.\n\n### What Changed\n- Converted the billing Vuex module (`src/store/billing/index.js` and `actions.js`) into a Pinia store using `defineStore` with the composition API style.\n- Removed the `Billing` module from the Vuex store registration in `src/store/index.js`.\n- Updated `billing.vue`, `activeContacts.vue`, and `invoices.vue` to map actions from `useBillingStore` via Pinia''s `mapActions` instead of Vuex''s.\n- Added unit tests for `useBillingStore` covering all actions, including default argument handling and error propagation.\n- Updated the existing `billing.spec.js` view test to mock `getActiveContacts` through the Pinia testing store instead of a Vuex action mock.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkXr0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANkgQACZDt+1JxejA6/CbA0RAHrjF\no3kZRhcGlLbKDubYsc5qWHGsYs/YeyLEVtIpg1pA+ZXuFK7rhlT0gf3J/ZYZHBDQ\ng2iKRFB9QC6AMh7ehW0wyXeABXsu5Z3orfNjPwMHjfE6WkdYB38ChozimHKVg/F7\nijl/rrVvclvMbm1d6zIWHeSFjPrszT0RwbcZB+Ody3R3tY9ZAb1qBEBvm7fhfi9a\n78d1Ap0V26ujyAAvjfVDjI8NNapmmaz+lQnmPFeoMh/qENVlgBCdUxJ1ghvtuPGU\n8pGEnQdXG+8hqkkRm9kgWPzNM9LLqdto40BKzAjzPbu3TJRPXF6RfQY4vLUVQqtA\nzTa8IuU9s206nxJXLz9ANBwPxp+4ibLcnxNEIXVtMqCo05akGySaGWXjq9ia1gOm\nKsEBZN1hSYBWLwx69yrUyw2Iw4wyMhAWKYhIX45BbQ7qxL89pDBpwcW9JikAXfSD\n+MuWQPtEwrVTeDl8AuzB7gNwcqaUAdrKAl7b0EZX9Urp4PIdmaA1aEufzGOKKkIq\ng/XdqszUqEPcW2zXxNd13Xs34fH5V/ulBeYzGOjoHiah//ABv0uN8ySynCRDmtlO\nfa16UWaFus6tk+bqkpCnxpkrE8qLm4I1VHUVsw1k56kmLJvJufYv1T+koEb37thv\nWJAl3i+oeI2KE7cRQJ+d\n=lR50\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T12:11:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"star