/api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commit/cd22180364bc6f988d48cbeeda5fe6c9a25b0db5","node_id":"C_kwDOEqKwutoAKGNkMjIxODAzNjRiYzZmOTg4ZDQ4Y2JlZWRhNWZlNmM5YTI1YjBkYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commit/1d0117d8d82a4627ef768af7ab1daea51d735ffb","sha":"1d0117d8d82a4627ef768af7ab1daea51d735ffb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/1d0117d8d82a4627ef768af7ab1daea51d735ffb"}],"sha":"cd22180364bc6f988d48cbeeda5fe6c9a25b0db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/cd22180364bc6f988d48cbeeda5fe6c9a25b0db5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30026625?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulobernardoaf","id":30026625,"login":"paulobernardoaf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDI2NjI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulobernardoaf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/commits/1d0117d8d82a4627ef768af7ab1daea51d735ffb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:05:32Z","email":"paulo.bernardo@vtex.com","name":"Paulo Bernardo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:05:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: migrate user management from Vuex to Pinia (#1184)\n\n### Type of Change\n- [ ] Feature\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [x] Refactor\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Chore\n- [ ] Locales\n\n### Why\nThe `Users` store was previously a Vuex module, which is inconsistent with the ongoing migration toward Pinia. Moving it to Pinia improves consistency across the store layer and allows components to consume it using Pinia''s `mapActions`.\n\n### What Changed\n- Converted the `Users` Vuex module into a Pinia store (`useUsersStore`) using the Composition API style (`defineStore` with a setup function).\n- Removed the `Users` module from the Vuex store registration.\n- Updated `UserManagement.vue` to import `mapActions` from Pinia and bind `searchUsers` from `useUsersStore`.\n- Updated `searchUser.vue` to use `mapActions` from Pinia with `useUsersStore` instead of Vuex.\n- Added unit tests for `useUsersStore` covering successful search calls and API error propagation.\n- Updated the `searchUser.spec.js` tests to use `createTestingPinia` and interact with the Pinia store instead of a mocked Vuex store.","tree":{"sha":"c8000fc517bc7a40ccbfd1edb77acce47b10e0a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/trees/c8000fc517bc7a40ccbfd1edb77acce47b10e0a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/weni-webapp/git/commits/1d0117d8d82a4627ef768af7ab1daea51d735ffb","verification":{"payload":"tree c8000fc517bc7a40ccbfd1edb77acce47b10e0a2\nparent c1b38730e88c3a8e32fb2eb7ba5dd685663eee9a\nparent 5f2d4b963972d9a5cb428e54fb1a5c7eef438b31\nauthor Paulo Bernardo <paulo.bernardo@vtex.com> 1787918732 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787918732 -0300\n\nrefactor: migrate user management from Vuex to Pinia (#1184)\n\n### Type of Change\n- [ ] Feature\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [x] Refactor\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Chore\n- [ ] Locales\n\n### Why\nThe `Users` store was previously a Vuex module, which is inconsistent with the ongoing migration toward Pinia. Moving it to Pinia improves consistency across the store layer and allows components to consume it using Pinia''s `mapActions`.\n\n### What Changed\n- Converted the `Users` Vuex module into a Pinia store (`useUsersStore`) using the Composition API style (`defineStore` with a setup function).\n- Removed the `Users` module from the Vuex store registration.\n- Updated `UserManagement.vue` to import `mapActions` from Pinia and bind `searchUsers` from `useUsersStore`.\n- Updated `searchUser.vue` to use `mapActions` from Pinia with `useUsersStore` instead of Vuex.\n- Added unit tests for `useUsersStore` covering successful search calls and API error propagation.\n- Updated the `searchUser.spec.js` tests to use `createTestingPinia` and interact with the Pinia store instead of a mocked Vuex store.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkXmNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAadcQAIUK6xYOxZYhaSZv9+EVRLDk\nIp0/9B+eCNzmyMU8ELtmuWgm5K/T6UFMrJ5CUtRE7twHSB1FMBkspY4IPVBKNgPu\nOJWo49kgFY+DHaNNa0t5MLNNsUw7qe9ZXuuLzfpzsY3Od8cFyyNr12sbdJS457Z1\nsWiJEV7wa05tyx1Vm/p0APYRYLuZS/56sSGem1hwtywjHM2zfrQvkp1GZEhVQJC4\n37Yi/au6SCAIyzw1p5GGeIw7++2u7L28fewE1lBxklOoNL9rzGvIEJaqO0EF/+Y2\nmK2w6o0Q5LKEsCDYLqgWKA7VL+rhGLlFZmeALZ0PHr7zXORfmYMHS28axVtYAQ+R\nf7aMnc9Ci7OIzmFwABfyiuVkwg1Bj2PWH/2ilpg/2vN+N9K/Ag1FJ6Dinl8SA3/G\nedW6B1mvhnrXNrkMfBXZa3ChCKQfeOBh/3ykIaRcz6uiX+IOnzthO1WVxX6zwBwJ\nZp+xvY81FTEb1iNCrvtfszicCGhXFU+k1tfritY9P85P61RSvirmGHvAuWwfFCjO\nPcUMAR6BIWMvMaJkLgpSK3mJ0otRzw5eU9qIZ0jLjrfsu421JNW/9HMgMxrPxoEH\nR792aBhi0Kd71Z9vbGE9YC+mwYVSjYOkU7MBziMDAoOslDzRqYWYXNyiTRqw22uW\nGpX+017aevbAb+CsSwiJ\n=KNtB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T12:05:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gith