pooya.golchian@gmail.com","name":"Pooya Golchian"},"message":"feat: remove old font files and VueMultipleThemes component\n\n- Deleted icomoon.ttf and icomoon.woff font files from the dist/fonts directory.\n- Removed VueMultipleThemes component files (esm, min, ssr) from the dist directory.\n- Updated VueMultipleThemes.vue component to include TypeScript support and improved template structure.\n- Enhanced useTheme composable to handle undefined theme names and ensure proper theme application.","tree":{"sha":"165ebbdb7f4328da64f854af326094e9546407b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pooyagolchian/vue-multiple-themes/git/trees/165ebbdb7f4328da64f854af326094e9546407b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pooyagolchian/vue-multiple-themes/git/commits/8c9b836f3fd189f4ad4cc1d04884b188edbff5da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8122611?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pooyagolchian","id":8122611,"login":"pooyagolchian","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMjI2MTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pooyagolchian","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pooyagolchian/vue-multiple-themes/commit/8c9b836f3fd189